LobbyPanel (Friends Mode – UI only):

LobbyPanel
│
├── PlayerInfoBar
│   ├── AvatarImage
│   └── PlayerNameText
│
├── RoomSection
│   ├── RoomCodeText
│   ├── CopyRoomCodeButton
│   └── RoomCodeInputField   // Used only for Join
│
├── PlayerList
│   ├── PlayerSlot_1   // You (Host or Client)
│   │   ├── PlayerNameText
│   │   └── StatusText (Ready - Green)
│   │
│   └── PlayerSlot_2   // Second Player (Same Prefab)
│       ├── PlayerNameText OR EmptyText
│       └── StatusText (Waiting - Yellow / Joined - Green)
│
└── ActionButtons
    ├── CreateRoomButton
    ├── JoinRoomButton
    └── StartGameButton   // Host Only


PlayerSlot Prefab (Reusable for Both Players): 

PlayerSlot (Prefab)
│
├── Background
│
├── PlayerNameText
│   └── (Hidden if slot empty)
│
├── EmptyText ("Waiting for Player...")
│   └── (Visible only when no player joined)
│
└── StatusText
    ├── Ready    (Green)
    ├── Waiting  (Yellow)
    └── Joined   (Green)




